bf20a1136c8707d9deae5f80a91707596b31fd579e4fad204da1c93c7f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-141140" :question/id #uuid "6ab70a1a-e04b-524f-9866-e86f88144126" :question/math-academy-id "q-141140" :question/is-example false :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13932088/assets/b362831ba2248e03537551c412ae7537646dcd09f0d00a598905f0d52a258da9.png)\n\nA part of the graph of a polynomial $p(x)$ is given above. Which of the following statements is true?" :question/worked-solution "| Multiplicity | Sketch | Sketch |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $1$ \n\n (Simple Root) | ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13932088/assets/5a0221f93c65a1eeb4503604a558a6da81c4c7af81c2c52cc35ecf3d189fe99f.png) | ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13932088/assets/d556b4edf39181eebb7ec87c344d6f657a6875ecd2745405eaf5351ccaff6f96.png) |\n| $>1$ \n\n (Multiple Root) \n\n Even | ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13932088/assets/9d14c2588da2ee9c9f5bbc32a70791146bed609ea0d6d5912aeaa2edab02e2d7.png) | ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13932088/assets/28ad9248a9a509e3a44937d0438fb2366f550a22360d01b9b6a29bcac41357e8.png) |\n| $>1$ \n\n (Multiple Root) \n\n Odd | ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13932088/assets/3ae81378cb3c918dd5b7730519eb5a91e949f88eef9f03f4910f4ab8fb3cd5a9.png) | ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13932088/assets/9506a7ce4031f1f6244c0110c3235f66ea5652bb53548a032732869cf21f5997.png) |\n\nIt's possible to determine information regarding the multiplicities of the roots of a polynomial from its graph.\n\n- If the graph intersects the $x$-axis but is *not* tangent to the $x$-axis at $x=a,$ we have a *simple* root $x=a.$\n\n- If the graph is *tangent* to the $x$-axis at $x=a,$ we have a *multiple* root $x=a.$ Furthermore:\n\n- If the graph touches the $x$-axis and reverses direction at $x=a,$ the multiplicity of a root $x=a$ is *even*.\n\n- If the graph crosses the $x$-axis at $x=a,$ the multiplicity of a root $x=a$ is *odd*.\n\nIn our case, the graph is *not* tangent to the $x$-axis at $x=-3.$ Therefore, $x=-3$ is a *simple* root." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-141140/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4d48e2a0-1a76-5eec-a98c-4a7eb16f70cb"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-141140"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-141133/selection/65f387f9264e63dc19d0170d92c31f46107be72451aeb445c7a63bfbfe3750b5" :answer/id #uuid "313267f6-a52b-5ab1-8f39-adc12038b6f5" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$x=-1$ is a simple root" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141133/selection/a448864e51a80cbda71e7cc17f9368e44a71a96edcb8a0934432758edd148a86" :answer/id #uuid "af65ca7e-728d-59d1-8b95-63128b4513e4" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$x=-1$ is a simple root of even multiplicity" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141133/selection/1a412ed70eeb92d0fa885ccbdcc30749bdedc4abb7a894bbfad48831d7671056" :answer/id #uuid "1f10636c-d501-5eb0-9e51-46bc6e1430e0" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$x=-1$ is a multiple root of even multiplicity" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141133/selection/63fe8d652d058b6b6b34f1e7f866709b2c656ee15cebbaf52fd790e43ee19678" :answer/id #uuid "902da21d-f90a-54f3-b5d8-214a0aa4b336" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$x=-1$ is a multiple root of odd multiplicity" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141133/selection/fc900db54697e01e9cd11eba282c2194a8cc7846d78c9f84087ee72b2bf980be" :answer/id #uuid "10067495-6d79-5623-acb4-583cd9cdacc0" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$x=-1$ is not a root of $p(x)$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/i